- `:depends` (`ExtensionSet`)
- `:extension` (`ExtensionAdapter`)
- `:options` (`ExtensionSet`)

**Reference**

https://ant.apache.org/manual/Tasks/jarlib-manifest.html

**Defined by**

`org.apache.tools.ant.taskdefs.optional.extension.JarLibManifestTask`"
