 is the empty string?", :required "No; default is true"}, :targetos {:description "The target architecture. Must be one of unix, windows, netware, tandem or os/2. This is a shorthand mechanism for specifying both pathsep and dirsep according to the specified target architecture.", :required "No"}}}
